 R_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall x,y\\in E\\;(d(x,y)\\leq M)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boundedness}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Bounded}_S(E,X,d)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(X,d)\\land E\\subseteq X\\land\n\\exists M\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall x,y\\in E\\;(d(x,y)\\leq M)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 有界当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{diam}(E)=\\sup\\{d(x,y):x,y\\in E\\}&lt;\\infty\">\\(\\operatorname{diam}(E)=\\sup\\{d(x,y):x,y\\in E\\}&lt;\\infty\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>Arzelà-Ascoli: equicontinuous + pointwise bounded <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\implies\">\\(\\implies\\)</span> precompact in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C(X)\">\\(C(X)\\)</span></li>\n<li>预紧性是不同概念，应由独立原子定义；本文件不再把它作为第二个定义混入。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> bounded in normed space <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iff\">\\(\\iff\\)</span> sup norm finite; norm controls metric</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Rudin, Functional Analysis</li>\n<li>Conway, A Course in Functional Analysis</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"ce876585d129ce97","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"ce876585d129ce97","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"